   8: # Line 1 is the conclusion. Line 2 is WHAT THE CONCLUSION WAS DERIVED FROM. That pairing is the
   9: # whole point: every past incident was line 1 disagreeing with line 2 while only line 1 was
  10: # visible. Anything else - a conflict, an unresolved chain, a git state - APPENDS below. The two
  11: # lines never change shape, so they are always in the same place and always mean the same thing.
