  12: (`loop/work/guard-branch-switch.ps1`). This sitting is a nested agent — interactive coordinator
  13: session → conductor (subagent) → this orchestrator (subagent of a subagent). The sitting ran a
  14: deliberately deniable, otherwise harmless PowerShell tool call:
