  20: Result: the hook FIRED and DENIED — the full `BLOCKED: this is the MAIN worktree...` message
  21: arrived in this agent's transcript as the tool error, exit 2. Two facts follow: PreToolUse hooks
  22: run for tool calls made by nested subagents at depth ≥ 2, and the deny text reaches the denied
  23: actor's transcript. (If hooks had not fired, the command was a no-op: "Already on 'main'".)
